enable output on the serial console. Then you have to attach a NULL modem
cable. It is not hard to build it yourself, just search on Google how to
build a serial NULL modem cable. The port settings are 9600 8 N 1

I had the same problem of yours and I could fix it moving on w3 switch and
building my own serial cable.
good luck

